  "hoare:v1:b7b451da31b9afa1eb68206271644b72f8b11629badaa721fc19e9e0876b3383": "Create a contact table in Sheet1. In column A, enter the column header \"Name\" and list five names below it: Alice, Brian, Chloe, Daniel, and Emma. In column B, enter the column header \"Email\" and list their emails below it: alice@google.com, brian@google.com, alice@google.com, chloe@google.com, and brian@google.com. Then apply conditional formatting to the Email column so duplicate email values are bolded.",
