  "hoare:v1:cce5f019af9a206c47f7578ad58589787c737f2d5ce9dd22e31995913108341d": "Create a product sales table in Sheet1. In column A, enter the column header \"Product\" and list four products below it: Pen, Notebook, Folder, and Tape. In column B, enter the column header \"Quantity\" and list their quantities below it: 4, 3, 6, and 2. In column C, enter the column header \"Unit Price\" and list their unit prices below it: 1.5, 4.25, 2.1, and 3.75. Then add a column D with the header \"Line Total\" and calculate each line total by multiplying Quantity by Unit Price.",
  "hoare:v1:d13246bd523e89f5895d8ef95a5a6924ed6f334a25978f047f6e0aea273516b9": "Create an employee table in Sheet1. In column A, enter the column header \"Name\". Enter Alice in A2, leave A3 blank, enter Chloe in A4, leave A5 blank, and enter Evan in A6. In column B, enter the column header \"Role\" and list the roles below it: Manager, Analyst, Designer, Engineer, and Intern. In column C, enter the column header \"Status\" and list the statuses below it: Active, Active, Leave, Active, and Pending. Then fill every blank cell in column A within A2:A6 with \"Unknown\".",
